{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Windowsdns.exe拉起异常子进程。对应需求：横向移动。官方：Unusual Child Process of dns.exe。","false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"from":"now-9m","index":["endgame-*","logs-crowdstrike.fdr*","logs-endpoint.events.process-*","logs-m365_defender.event-*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*","logs-system.security*","logs-windows.forwarded*","logs-windows.sysmon_operational-*","winlogbeat-*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Windowsdns.exe拉起异常子进程","references":["https://research.checkpoint.com/2020/resolving-your-way-into-domain-admin-exploiting-a-17-year-old-bug-in-windows-dns-servers/","https://msrc-blog.microsoft.com/2020/07/14/july-2020-security-update-cve-2020-1350-vulnerability-in-windows-domain-name-system-dns-server/","https://github.com/maxpl0it/CVE-2020-1350-DoS","https://www.elastic.co/security-labs/detection-rules-for-sigred-vulnerability"],"risk_score":73,"rule_id":"8c37dc0e-e3ac-4c97-8aa0-cf6a9122de45","severity":"high","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 横向移动","来源: 默认","对应需求: 横向移动"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"windows\" and event.type == \"start\" and\n  process.parent.name : \"dns.exe\" and\n  not process.executable : (\n    \"?:\\\\Windows\\\\System32\\\\conhost.exe\",\n    \"?:\\\\Windows\\\\System32\\\\dns.exe\",\n\n    /* Crowdstrike specific exclusion as it uses NT Object paths */\n    \"\\\\Device\\\\HarddiskVolume*\\\\Windows\\\\System32\\\\conhost.exe\",\n    \"\\\\Device\\\\HarddiskVolume*\\\\Windows\\\\System32\\\\dns.exe\",\n    \"\\\\Device\\\\HarddiskVolume*\\\\Program Files\\\\ReasonLabs\\\\*\"\n  ) and\n  not ?process.parent.executable : \"?:\\\\Program Files\\\\ReasonLabs\\\\DNS\\\\ui\\\\DNS.exe\"\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindowsdns.exe拉起异常子进程\n\n### 为何重要\n向其他主机扩散\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","event.action","event.code","file.path","registry.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1210","name":"Exploitation of Remote Services","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1210/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0008","name":"Lateral Movement","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0008/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1190","name":"Exploit Public-Facing Application","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1190/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0001","name":"Initial Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0001/"}}],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"windows","version":"*"},{"package":"system","version":"*"},{"package":"m365_defender","version":"*"},{"package":"sentinel_one_cloud_funnel","version":"*"},{"package":"crowdstrike","version":"*"}],"version":321,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
